\fIlevel\fP A level between 0 and \fBP8EST_MAXLEVEL\fP included\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
true if \fI\fP(coord[0],coord[1],coord[2],level) is valid\&. 
.RE
.PP

