.br
\fIlevel\fP The level of the regular grid compared to which the linear position is to be computed\&. The level must be less equal P8EST_OLD_MAXLEVEL since this is a legacy function restricted to 64 bits\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Returns the linear position of this quadrant on a grid\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
The user_data of \fIquadrant\fP is never modified\&. 
.RE
.PP

