Shifts a quadrant until it touches the specified edge from the inside\&. If this shift is meant to recreate the effects of \fIq\fP on balancing across the edge, then \fIr\fP, \fIrup\fP, and \fIrdown\fP may all be necessary for that recreation\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIq\fP Valid input quadrant\&. 
.br
\fIr\fP Quadrant whose Morton index will be filled\&. This quadrant results from shifting \fIq\fP laterally towards the edge\&. 
.br
\fIrup\fP Quadrant whose Morton index will be filled (may be NULL)\&. This quadrant results from shifting \fIq\fP diagonally towards \fIedge's\fP higher corner\&. 
.br
\fIrdown\fP Quadrant whose Morton index will be filled (may be NULL)\&. This quadrant results from shifting \fIq\fP diagonally towards \fIedge's\fP lower corner\&. 
.br
\fIedge\fP Edge index\&. 
.RE
.PP

